{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, then approach and grab it. Move, check and finally do task. If not visible, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTargetLocation    /> <Action ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = FindObjectTask    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectPropertiesTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />\"",
